OL,3,GNEWSAHigher seafront parking fines
OL,4,Acould extend to schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA month long trial of higher fines for
OL,7,Fillegal parking near a seafront has
OL,8,Fconcluded.
OL,10,FDuring August 2026, fines on 543
OL,11,Fcoastal roads from Sandbanks to
OL,12,FSouthbourne were increased to #160 by
OL,13,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,14,F(BCP) Council.
OL,16,FThe council said it will discuss the
OL,17,Ffindings of the trial with the
OL,18,FDepartment for Transport (DfT) before
OL,19,Frevealing the figures in due course.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
