OL,3,GNEWSAHigher seafront parking fines
OL,4,Acould extend to schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FCllr Richard Herret said, depending on
OL,7,Fthat feedback, higher fines could be
OL,8,Fextended to roads around schools where
OL,9,F"safety is almost more critical than
OL,10,Faround the beach".
